 "ContainersRunningSelectedDetailsOpen": {
  "name": "Containers, Running, selected, Details open",
  "caption": "Running, selected, Details open.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Containers</span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__metric\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__metric-number\">2.1 GB</span><span class=\"kanso-metric__unit\">held</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\" style=\"margin-left:auto\">Quit Docker</span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-section\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__state\">acme-shop</span></div><div class=\"kanso-row kanso-panel__compact-row\"><span>compose.yaml</span><span class=\"kanso-text--dim\" style=\"font-size:var(--k-fs-meta)\">2 of 3 up</span><span class=\"kanso-layout__grow\"></span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-text--foreground\">Up again</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Rebuild</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Down</span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-row--two-lines\" title=\"postgres:16 :5432\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-content__primary\"><svg class=\"kanso-mark kanso-mark--blocked kanso-mark--small\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg><span>api-db</span><span class=\"kanso-panel__row-value kanso-text--blocked\">exited 1 · 3 min</span></div>\n                \n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-row--two-lines kanso-row--selected\" title=\"axllent/mailpit :8025 · up 2 h\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-content__primary kanso-panel__compact-row\"><svg class=\"kanso-mark kanso-mark--done kanso-mark--small\"><use href=\"#e-done\"/></svg><span>mailpit</span><span class=\"kanso-panel__row-value\">31 MB</span></div>\n                \n                <div class=\"kanso-content__actions kanso-panel__actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-text--foreground\">Open</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Logs</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Shell</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Restart</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Stop</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Less</span></div>\n                <div class=\"kanso-panel__row--indented\" style=\"margin-top:var(--k-sp-3)\">\n                  <div class=\"kanso-panel__key-value\"><span>Ports</span><span>8025 → 8025/tcp, 1025 → 1025/tcp</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-panel__key-value\"><span>Mounts</span><span>mailpit-data → /data</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-panel__key-value\"><span>Networks</span><span>acme-shop_default</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-panel__key-value\"><span>Restarts</span><span>unless-stopped</span></div>\n                  <div class=\"kanso-panel__key-value\"><span>Id</span><span>3f9c1a7e20b4</span></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-row--two-lines\"><div class=\"kanso-content__primary kanso-panel__compact-row\"><span>redis</span><span class=\"kanso-panel__row-value\">9 MB</span></div><div class=\"kanso-content__actions kanso-panel__actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Stop</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Restart</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Shell</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Logs</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Details</span></div></div>\n            </div></div></div>",
  "spec": [
   [
    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: Running, selected, Details open"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
   ],
   [
    "States",
    "Running, selected, Details open"
   ],
   [
    "Behaviour",
    "Actions show on the selected row, by state. Failed: Logs is the primary (why it failed), then Start, Details, Remove. Running: Open (web ports), Logs, Shell, Restart, Stop. Details stay a fold inside the row."
