 "ContainersDownAndQuitArmedARemovalRefusedOnItsRowNotInAProject": {
  "name": "Containers, Down and Quit armed · a removal refused, on its row · not in a project",
  "caption": "Down and Quit armed · a removal refused, on its row · not in a project.",
  "html": "<div class=\"kanso-story\"><div class=\"kanso-story__theme kanso-story__frame kanso-panel\"><div class=\"kanso-panel\">\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__header\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__title\">Containers</span><span class=\"kanso-button--icon\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-refresh-cw\"/></svg></span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-panel__metric\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__metric-number\">2.1 GB</span><span class=\"kanso-metric__unit\">held</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-action kanso-action--armed\" style=\"margin-left:auto\"><span>Quit Docker (stops 3)</span><span>Press again to quit Docker</span></span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-section\"><span class=\"kanso-panel__state\">acme-shop</span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-row\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon kanso-icon--row kanso-text--muted\"><use href=\"#lu-container\"/></svg>compose.yaml<span class=\"kanso-text--dim\" style=\"font-size:var(--k-fs-meta)\">2 of 3</span><span class=\"kanso-layout__grow\"></span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-text--foreground\">Up again</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Rebuild</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-action kanso-action--armed\"><span>Down</span><span>Press again: down</span></span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-row--two-lines kanso-row--selected\" title=\"postgres:16 :5432\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-content__primary\"><svg class=\"kanso-mark kanso-mark--working kanso-mark--small\"><use href=\"#e-work\"/></svg><span>api-db</span></div>\n                \n                <div class=\"kanso-panel__row--indented\"><div class=\"kanso-state-block kanso-state-block--on-row\"><svg class=\"kanso-mark kanso-mark--blocked\"><use href=\"#e-blk\"/></svg><div class=\"kanso-state-block__what\">Couldn't remove api-db</div><div class=\"kanso-state-block__why\" title=\"Error response from daemon: cannot remove container &quot;api-db&quot;: container is restarting\">Error response from daemon: cannot remove container &quot;api-db&quot;: container is restarting</div><div class=\"kanso-state-block__actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button--tonal\">Remove</span><span class=\"kanso-button--tonal\"><svg class=\"kanso-icon\"><use href=\"#lu-bot\"/></svg>Explain to checkout</span></div></div></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-row--two-lines\"><div class=\"kanso-content__primary kanso-panel__compact-row\"><span>mailpit</span><span class=\"kanso-panel__row-value\">31 MB</span></div><div class=\"kanso-content__actions kanso-panel__actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Stop</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Restart</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Open</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Shell</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Logs</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Details</span></div></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-section\"><span class=\"kanso-text--muted\">Not in a project</span></div>\n              <div class=\"kanso-row--two-lines kanso-row--selected\" title=\"moby/buildkit:v0.17\">\n                <div class=\"kanso-content__primary\"><svg class=\"kanso-mark kanso-mark--idle kanso-mark--small\"><use href=\"#e-idle\"/></svg><span class=\"kanso-text--muted\">buildkit</span><span class=\"kanso-panel__row-value kanso-text--dim\">stopped · 2 d</span></div>\n                \n                <div class=\"kanso-content__actions kanso-panel__actions\"><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-text--foreground\">Start</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Logs</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet\">Details</span><span class=\"kanso-button--quiet kanso-action kanso-action--armed\"><span>Remove</span><span>Press again to remove</span></span></div>\n              </div>\n            </div></div></div>",
  "spec": [
   [
    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: Down and Quit armed · a removal refused, on its row · not in a project"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
