    "Anatomy",
    "the panel as the app draws it: header, scope, body from the kit primitives\nstate: First read"
   ],
   [
    "Values",
    "panel 368 wide · padding 16 · rows 32 · meta 11.5 dim\nonly kit tokens; no colour but the marks"
